1
00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:12.570
Willie had another meltdown today.

2
00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:14.610
She ripped up a textbook and shoved a classmate.

3
00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:16.610
Did you not talk to her after our last conversation?

4
00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:17.910
We've been trying to calm her down.

5
00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:20.550
Her father moving out was clearly traumatic.

6
00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:22.050
Don't trigger her any further.

7
00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:23.390
If things don't improve by next week,

8
00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:31.990
the school will reconsider her enrollment.

9
00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:33.830
Babe, you're finally out.

10
00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:36.250
I passed the first round of interviews.

11
00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:38.690
That's great, but there's still another round.

12
00:00:38.690 --> 00:00:40.290
Don't celebrate yet.

13
00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:41.890
Just put in one good word for me

14
00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:43.230
and I'll get this job for sure.

15
00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:46.870
Do not expect me to walk you through the entire process.

16
00:00:46.890 --> 00:00:51.380
I have to get back to work.

17
00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:52.880
Work?

18
00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:54.980
You can't even spare 10 minutes for me?

19
00:00:54.980 --> 00:01:00.280
The company is extremely busy right now.

20
00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:01.420
Stop leaving me hanging.

21
00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:02.760
Come over tonight.

22
00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:04.460
I know how to help you relax.

23
00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:06.060
Not here.

24
00:01:06.060 --> 00:01:08.260
I'm really not in the mood for this right now.

25
00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:09.660
Willa got in trouble at school again.

26
00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:15.470
I'm completely overwhelmed.

27
00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:16.310
What is it now?
